  annotation(Documentation(info="<html><h2>星务任务与指令控制组件</h2><p><b>类路径：</b><code>OneSatSim.Components.MissionControlUnit</code>　<b>类型：</b>model</p><h3>用途与定位</h3><p>星务任务与指令控制组件</p><h3>在工程中使用</h3><p>当前直接使用位置：<a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Components.OnboardComputerUnit\">OneSatSim.Components.OnboardComputerUnit</a> 的 <code>missionControl</code>。</p><h3>接口、输入与输出</h3><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>名称/维数</th><th>类型</th><th>声明角色</th><th>单位</th><th>含义</th></tr><tr><td><code>environment</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.EnvironmentPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>外部环境接口或实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>device</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.DeviceStatusBus</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>计算/接口量 device</td></tr><tr><td><code>payload</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.PayloadDataPort</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>计算/接口量 payload</td></tr><tr><td><code>command</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.CommandBus</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>指令</td></tr><tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.CommandStatusBus</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>计算/接口量 status</td></tr><tr><td><code>activeMissionSelection</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.ActiveMissionSelectionOutput</td><td>public</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>来自OBC的任务对象锁存索引</td></tr><tr><td><code>feedbackBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.MissionFeedbackBus</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>反馈总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>opportunityBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.OpportunitySignals</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>opportunity总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>activeGeometryBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.ActiveGeometrySignals</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>激活几何总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>requestBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.PlannerRequestSignals</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>请求总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>safetyBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.SafetySignals</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>safety总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>decisionBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.ArbiterDecisionSignals</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>decision总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>stateBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.MissionStateSignals</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>状态总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>imagingActionBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.ImagingActionSignals</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>成像Action总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>downlinkActionBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.DownlinkActionSignals</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>下传Action总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>safeActionBus</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.SafeModeActionSignals</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>安全模式Action总线</td></tr><tr><td><code>targetPreparationReadyReader</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.OpportunityBooleanReader</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>机会总线布尔信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>targetEarlyOpportunityReader</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.OpportunityBooleanReader</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>机会总线布尔信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>targetPreparationIndexReader</code></td><td>Foundation.Interfaces.OpportunityIntegerReader</td><td>protected</td><td>按声明/类型合同</td><td>机会总线整数信号到因果计算端口的无状态恒等读取器实例</td></tr></table><h3>配置与参数</h3><p>下面列出当前源码表达式，仅用于阅读；当前参数对话框、生效配置记录与原有配置工具仍是使用依据。本页不新增默认值或换算。</p><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>用途</th><th>源码表达式</th></tr><tr><td><code>operationalSnapshotStart</code></td><td>Boolean</td><td>配置项 operationalSnapshotStart</td><td><code>=true</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>imagingCapabilities</code></td><td>OneSatSim.Foundation.Types.ImagingCapabilities</td><td>成像Capabilities；Earth-camera capability from spacecraft design configuration</td><td><code>由调用方、继承或默认声明提供</code></td></tr></table><h3>内部组成</h3><p>以下为本类直接声明的组成单元，继承类的内部结构另按其文档查看。</p><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\"><tr><th>实例</th><th>类</th><th>作用</th></tr><tr><td><code>opportunity</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionOpportunityGenerator\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionOpportunityGenerator</a></td><td>原始机会与活动对象几何生成器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>planner</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionPlanner\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionPlanner</a></td><td>对象感知的任务规划器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>safety</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.SafetyMonitor\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.SafetyMonitor</a></td><td>带回差的任务安全许可监视器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>arbiter</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.CommandArbiter\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.CommandArbiter</a></td><td>任务请求的单入口事件锁存仲裁器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>stateMachine</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionStateMachine\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionStateMachine</a></td><td>单向动作握手的事件驱动任务状态机实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>physicalFeedback</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionFeedbackAdapter\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionFeedbackAdapter</a></td><td>物理状态到任务反馈的选择适配器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>imagingSequencer</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.ImagingSequencer\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.ImagingSequencer</a></td><td>请求驱动的成像动作时序器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>downlinkSequencer</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.DownlinkSequencer\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.DownlinkSequencer</a></td><td>请求驱动的下行动作时序器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>safeSequencer</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.SafeModeSequencer\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.SafeModeSequencer</a></td><td>请求驱动的安全进入、保持与恢复时序器实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>resultMailbox</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionActionResultMailbox\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionActionResultMailbox</a></td><td>任务动作结果事件邮箱实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>requestMailbox</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionActionRequestMailbox\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionActionRequestMailbox</a></td><td>任务动作请求事件邮箱实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>geometryMailbox</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionGeometryEventMailbox\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.MissionGeometryEventMailbox</a></td><td>活动目标几何事件邮箱实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>adapter</code></td><td><a href=\"modelica://OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.CommandAdapter\">OneSatSim.Foundation.Models.CommandAdapter</a></td><td>任务接口到设备指令与状态的纯映射实例</td></tr></table></html>"
),
